{"id":"ce3dce3f65cf0012","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-lem-interpolation.md","title":"Craig Interpolation","display":"lem-interpolation — Craig Interpolation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-interpolation","aliases":["58-lem-interpolation"],"display":"lem-interpolation — Craig Interpolation","depends_on":["[[./58-df-derivable.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-interpolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-interpolation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-interpolation — Craig Interpolation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c470f913608b6d60\" href=\"?note=c470f913608b6d60\" title=\"./58-df-derivable.md\">58-df-derivable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\varphi,\\psi\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,\\varphi,\\psi\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Derivable}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Derivable}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c470f913608b6d60\" href=\"?note=c470f913608b6d60\" title=\"./58-df-derivable.md\">58-df-derivable.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TermVoc}_\\Sigma:\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}}\\cup\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}})\">\\(\\operatorname{TermVoc}_\\Sigma:\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}}\\cup\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}}\\cup\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\cup\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}})\">\\(\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}}\\cup\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\cup\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}})\\)</span> are defined recursively here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpolation\\text{-}term\\text{-}vocabulary}\\vdash\nt\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\operatorname{TermVoc}_\\Sigma(t)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\varnothing,&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\\\\n\\{t\\},&amp;t\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\\\\n\\{f\\}\\cup\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{j\\in a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}\\operatorname{TermVoc}_\\Sigma(t_j),\n&amp;t=f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)-1}).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpolation\\text{-}term\\text{-}vocabulary}\\vdash\nt\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\operatorname{TermVoc}_\\Sigma(t)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\varnothing,&amp;t\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\\\\n\\{t\\},&amp;t\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cnst}},\\\\\n\\{f\\}\\cup\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{j\\in a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)}\\operatorname{TermVoc}_\\Sigma(t_j),\n&amp;t=f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{a_{\\mathrm{fn}}(f)-1}).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpolation\\text{-}formula\\text{-}vocabulary}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\chi)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{TermVoc}_\\Sigma(t_1)\\cup\\operatorname{TermVoc}_\\Sigma(t_2),&amp;\\chi=(t_1\\doteq t_2),\\\\\n\\{R\\}\\cup\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{j\\in a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(R)}\\operatorname{TermVoc}_\\Sigma(t_j),&amp;\\chi=R(t_0,\\ldots,t_{a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(R)-1}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\theta),&amp;\\chi=\\neg\\theta,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\theta)\\cup\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\rho),&amp;\\chi=(\\theta\\lor\\rho),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\theta),&amp;\\chi=\\forall x\\,\\theta.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpolation\\text{-}formula\\text{-}vocabulary}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\chi)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{TermVoc}_\\Sigma(t_1)\\cup\\operatorname{TermVoc}_\\Sigma(t_2),&amp;\\chi=(t_1\\doteq t_2),\\\\\n\\{R\\}\\cup\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{j\\in a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(R)}\\operatorname{TermVoc}_\\Sigma(t_j),&amp;\\chi=R(t_0,\\ldots,t_{a_{\\mathrm{rel}}(R)-1}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\theta),&amp;\\chi=\\neg\\theta,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\theta)\\cup\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\rho),&amp;\\chi=(\\theta\\lor\\rho),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\theta),&amp;\\chi=\\forall x\\,\\theta.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}interpolation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Derivable}_S(\\{\\varphi\\},\\psi,\\Sigma)\\to\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Derivable}_S(\\{\\varphi\\},\\theta,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Derivable}_S(\\{\\theta\\},\\psi,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\theta)\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\cap\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\psi)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}interpolation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Derivable}_S(\\{\\varphi\\},\\psi,\\Sigma)\\to\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Derivable}_S(\\{\\varphi\\},\\theta,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Derivable}_S(\\{\\theta\\},\\psi,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\theta)\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\cap\\operatorname{Voc}_\\Sigma(\\psi)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Craig interpolation: between proof and consequence lies an interpolant.</li>\n<li>The common-vocabulary condition concerns nonlogical symbols, not free variables.</li>\n<li>The implication form is used: an interpolant lies between a premise formula <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> and a conclusion formula <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>. The earlier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span> clause was not Craig interpolation.</li>\n<li>It has applications in logic and computer science.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./58-df-derivable.md","status":"resolved","id":"c470f913608b6d60","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-derivable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-derivable.md","status":"resolved","id":"c470f913608b6d60","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Derivable}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[./58-df-derivable.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\varphi,\\psi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Derivable}_S\\subseteq V^3","display